# Background Processing Architecture

- Do not execute heavy GPU/AI calls, long-running transforms, video/image encoding, or external social API posting inside API route sync handlers.
- Enqueue work to BullMQ workers. The synchronous handler should return quickly with a `202 Accepted` status.
- Design all workers to be strictly idempotent and safe to retry. Use `p-retry` or explicit BullMQ retry policies.